// repeats every 180deg, and a 45deg rotation turns + into x. As the binary
// inspirals the wave chirps, frequency f ~ tau^(-3/8) and amplitude ~ tau^(-1/4)
// with tau = t_c - t the time to coalescence, and the GW frequency is twice the
// orbital frequency. The lower strip plots the whole chirp h_+(t) with a moving
