// and the IDLER arm gets the marginal mean over x_s. As z (= frame) advances, successive rows fill the
// trail top->bottom, so the arms read as waves travelling to the film / detector. Values are divided by
// the current frame peak so the developing trail is consistently bright. The two arms are projections of
